
### Get All Events
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/events/
Accept: application/json


### Add Event
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/events/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "event_name": "BIRTHDAY PARTY",
    "description": "Prepare for BDAY PARTY",
    "event_date": "2026-11-23",
    "event_time": "10:00:00",
    "location": "GEE BEE PALACE",
    "category": "BDAY",
    "reminder_date": "2026-11-20",
    "reminder_time": "07:00:00",
    "is_completed": false
}


### Get Event Details
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/events/1/


### Update Event
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/events/1/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "event_name": "Python Exam",
    "description": "Updated exam preparation",
    "event_date": "2026-11-10",
    "event_time": "10:00:00",
    "location": "College",
    "category": "Exam",
    "reminder_date": "2026-11-09",
    "reminder_time": "09:00:00",
    "is_completed": false
}


### Pending Events
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/events/pending/


### Completed Events
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/events/completed/


### Upcoming Events
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/events/upcoming/


### Mark Event Completed
PATCH http://127.0.0.1:8000/events/1/mark_completed/


### Delete Event
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/events/1/

